        <li id="fn4"><a href="https://docs.temporal.io/task-queue" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-link">Temporal task queues</a></li>
        <li id="fn5"><a href="https://github.com/rjpruitt16/aqueduct-benchmarks/blob/main/envoy/RESULTS.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-link">Aquifer’s Envoy benchmark results, including methodology, countercomparisons, and limitations</a></li>
        <li id="fn6"><a href="https://aws.amazon.com/builders-library/timeouts-retries-and-backoff-with-jitter/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-link">Amazon Builders’ Library: Timeouts, retries, and backoff with jitter</a></li>
        <li id="fn7"><a href="https://blog.cloudflare.com/radar-2025-year-in-review/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-link">Cloudflare’s 2025 Year in Review</a></li>
